<title>UK: LME amends constitution, expands board.</title>
<headline>LME amends constitution, expands board.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The London Metal Exchange (LME) said on Tuesday that its members had approved changes to the Exchanges' constitution, increasing the number of Board directors by two.</p>
<p>In a notice to members the LME said that at Monday's EGM five resolutions were passed and are therefore effective immediately.</p>
<p>The number of invited directors are increased from four to six...&quot;two of whom have substantial experience of the metals trade or business and four of whom have no current connection</p>
